<p>Gutter maintenance isn't complicated, but timing matters — especially in North Alabama. Our climate doesn't follow the simple "clean twice a year" advice you'll find in generic home maintenance guides.</p>

<p>This guide breaks down what to do and when, specifically for homeowners in Huntsville, Madison, Decatur, Athens, and surrounding areas. Follow this schedule and you'll catch problems early, avoid emergency repairs, and keep water flowing where it should.</p>
